460
01:07:57,745 --> 01:08:00,548
<i>Ini mesin pesan Doc dan Tipper.</i>

461
01:08:00,615 --> 01:08:02,850
<i>Tinggalkan pesan untuk kami.</i>

462
01:08:02,917 --> 01:08:05,887
Doc, ini KC. Telepon aku kembali secepatnya.

463
01:09:21,829 --> 01:09:23,463
Doc, Doc, itu kau?

464
01:09:23,531 --> 01:09:25,099
Apakah Chase baik-baik saja?

465
01:09:28,536 --> 01:09:29,904
Doc?

466
01:09:29,971 --> 01:09:34,241
<i>Nyonya Scarbro,</i> <i>kau tahu siapa aku?</i>

467
01:09:34,274 --> 01:09:36,010
Kau membunuh Bo...

468
01:09:36,077 --> 01:09:38,846
<i>Bo Brown membawa nyala api itu.</i>

469
01:09:38,913 --> 01:09:42,016
<i>Dia tidak memiliki</i> <i>tekad untuk menjadi nyala api itu.</i>

470
01:09:42,083 --> 01:09:43,417
Pergi ke neraka.

471
01:09:43,483 --> 01:09:44,786
<i>Bu?</i>

472
01:09:45,787 --> 01:09:47,254
Chase?

473
01:09:47,320 --> 01:09:49,924
Dasar bajingan, apa maumu?

474
01:09:49,991 --> 01:09:51,959
<i>Kau tahu.</i>

475
01:09:52,026 --> 01:09:53,427
Di mana?

476
01:09:53,493 --> 01:09:55,129
<i>Kau juga tahu itu.</i>

477
01:11:38,933 --> 01:11:40,034
Lepaskan dia.

478
01:11:47,141 --> 01:11:48,810
Senjatanya...

479
01:12:09,429 --> 01:12:11,098
Mari.

480
01:12:50,037 --> 01:12:51,138
Lepaskan Mamaku!

481
01:12:52,206 --> 01:12:54,441
Hentikan, hentikan.

482
01:12:54,508 --> 01:12:57,545
Chase, jangan, bersikaplah baik.

483
01:12:59,847 --> 01:13:04,451
Kalian sudah mengambil tanah kami, mengambil rumah kami.

484
01:13:04,518 --> 01:13:06,053
Biarkan kami pergi.

485
01:13:06,921 --> 01:13:10,691
Apa kau tidak ingin bertemu Jesse-mu lagi?

486
01:13:11,559 --> 01:13:12,860
Di mana dia?

487
01:13:13,928 --> 01:13:16,463
Kita adalah...

488
01:13:16,496 --> 01:13:18,799
keluarga.

489
01:13:19,800 --> 01:13:25,806
Dan keluarga harus bersatu.

490
01:13:30,511 --> 01:13:31,812
Apa-apaan?

491
01:13:36,483 --> 01:13:37,785
Lari, Chase!

492
01:14:02,543 --> 01:14:04,178
Kau punya penyesalan?

493
01:14:07,782 --> 01:14:09,550
Ya, aku punya beberapa.

494
01:14:18,526 --> 01:14:20,528
Tapi kurasa kau bukan salah satunya.

495
01:16:00,694 --> 01:16:01,996
Chase?

496
01:16:12,640 --> 01:16:13,974
Chase!

497
01:16:45,272 --> 01:16:46,373
Jesse?

498
01:16:48,876 --> 01:16:50,678
Bertahanlah, ya?

499
01:18:36,483 --> 01:18:37,985
Jangan mendekat.

500
01:18:47,629 --> 01:18:49,263
Kubilang jangan mendekat, sialan.

501
01:23:35,850 --> 01:23:37,284
Chase.

502
01:23:38,085 --> 01:23:40,087
Aku menemukan Ayah.

503
01:24:00,642 --> 01:24:02,109
KC.

504
01:24:46,153 --> 01:24:47,789
Maaf.

505
01:24:49,156 --> 01:24:51,191
Atas semua yang telah kulakukan.

506
01:24:52,159 --> 01:24:54,261
Seharusnya kita pergi saja.

507
01:24:57,031 --> 01:24:58,498
Tidak ada jalan untuk meninggalkannya.

508
01:25:00,034 --> 01:25:01,335
Oh, ayolah.

509
01:25:03,037 --> 01:25:04,438
Kau harus mencoba.

510
01:25:11,980 --> 01:25:14,214
Waktunya pergi, Nak.

511
01:25:15,449 --> 01:25:16,784
Jesse...

512
01:25:27,762 --> 01:25:28,930
Pergi.

513
01:25:34,569 --> 01:25:36,203
Pergi!

514
01:25:40,041 --> 01:25:42,309
Pergilah ke neraka!

515
01:26:36,698 --> 01:26:37,799
Pergi.

516
01:28:02,049 --> 01:28:03,918
<i>Terjadi ledakan besar.</i>

517
01:28:03,985 --> 01:28:06,854
<i>Banyak dinamit</i> <i>yang terlibat.</i> <i>Tenang saja,</i>

518
01:28:14,962 --> 01:28:17,832
<i>kami akan terus</i> <i>memperjuangkan

519
01:28:17,899 --> 01:28:22,270
pekerjaan batu bara bersih</i> <i>bagi warga

520
01:28:22,937 --> 01:28:27,440
Amerika</i> <i>dan kami akan melanjutkan</i> <i>penggalian di Gunung

521
01:28:27,508 --> 01:28:30,645
Trout</i> <i>pada kesempatan</i> <i>yang memungkinkan secepatnya.</i>

522
01:29:02,844 --> 01:29:03,945
Jesse?

523
01:29:15,990 --> 01:29:18,593
Pertarungan belum berakhir.

524
01:29:19,894 --> 01:29:23,430
Mereka akan terus datang lagi dan lagi.

525
01:29:38,045 --> 01:29:40,948
Kau gadis yang baik, KC Scarbro.

526
01:29:44,285 --> 01:29:46,621
Buat keluargamu bangga.

